{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 19, "data": [{"docid2": 2167177, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202511/t20251106_2167177.htm", "content": "\n　　根据2021年市国资委印发的《三明市市属国有企业投资监督管理办法》，市国资委明确市属企业投资负面清单及出资企业主辅业范围，对市属企业项目投资实施规范化管理。严格控制企业非主辅业投资行为；对列入负面清单", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202511/t20251106_2167177.htm", "docreltime": "2025.11.06 11:21:00", "doctitle": "三明市国资委如何对市属企业投资行为进行监督？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379629, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202511/t20251106_2167177.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202511/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2167174, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202511/t20251106_2167174.htm", "content": "\n　　市国资委每年根据中央、省上及市委、市政府工作部署，结合企业发展实际，下达当年度企业负责人经营业绩考核指标和薪酬管理办法，主要包括财务指标、年度重点工作任务、安全生产和消防工作、党风党纪等内容。其中", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202511/t20251106_2167174.htm", "docreltime": "2025.11.06 11:17:00", "doctitle": "三明市属企业经营业绩考核主要包含哪些内容？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379628, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202511/t20251106_2167174.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202511/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2161974, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/t20251016_2161974.htm", "content": "\n　　《若干措施》对新获批国家级平台基地的牵头企业给予一次性最高1000万元奖励。支持企业与高校院所共建联合实验室，符合条件的给予最高1000万元后补助。支持企业在省外设立的独立法人研发机构牵头申报我省“揭榜挂", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/t20251016_2161974.htm", "docreltime": "2025.10.16 10:50:00", "doctitle": "《关于支持企业加大研发投入加强研发活动的若干措施》在支持企业研发平台建设方面有什么新的规定？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379627, "sourcename": "三明市发改委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/t20251016_2161974.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2161973, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/t20251016_2161973.htm", "content": "\n　　《若干措施》聚焦我省重点产业领域，对年度研发经费支出高于200万元且较上年实现增长100万元以上的科技型企业，按企业年度研发经费支出较上年度增量的6%给予奖励补助，单个企业年度最高补助600万元，由省市县三", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/t20251016_2161973.htm", "docreltime": "2025.10.16 10:40:00", "doctitle": "《关于支持企业加大研发投入加强研发活动的若干措施》在重点产业领域有什么新的要求？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379626, "sourcename": "三明市发改委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/t20251016_2161973.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2161969, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/t20251016_2161969.htm", "content": "\n　　到2027年,数据产业规模年均复合增长率超过20%，打造5个以上数据产业集聚区、10个以上数据要素产业园，引育300家以上标杆和创新数据企业;培育120个以上公共数据典型应用场景,打造10个以上国家级示范场景;数据交易", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/t20251016_2161969.htm", "docreltime": "2025.10.16 10:29:00", "doctitle": "《福建省促进数据产业高质量发展行动计划（2025-2027年）》的目的是什么？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379625, "sourcename": "三明市发改委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/t20251016_2161969.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl_26224/202510/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2161672, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/kjj/kjzc/202510/t20251014_2161672.htm", "content": "\n　　2025年9月，福建省人民政府办公厅印发了《关于支持企业加大研发投入加强研发活动的若干措施》的通知（闽政办〔2025〕25号），文件链接为https://www.fujian.gov.cn/zwgk/zxwj/szfbgtwj/202509/t20250929_701710", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/kjj/kjzc/202510/t20251014_2161672.htm", "docreltime": "2025.10.14 21:13:00", "doctitle": "福建省关于支持企业加大研发投入方面有什么政策吗？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379624, "sourcename": "三明市科技局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/kjj/kjzc/202510/t20251014_2161672.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/kjj/kjzc/202510/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2134645, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/gygl/202506/t20250630_2134645.htm", "content": "\n　　（1）主导产品细分市场占有率居全国前10%或全省前3%；（2）近两年研发费用占比不低于3%；（3）拥有2项以上发明专利或5项以上实用新型专利。2025年名单已公布236家企业。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/gygl/202506/t20250630_2134645.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.11 09:57:00", "doctitle": "福建省对专精特新中小企业的认定标准是什么？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379622, "sourcename": "福建省工业和信息化厅", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/gygl/202506/t20250630_2134645.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/gygl/202506/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2134642, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/nygl/202506/t20250630_2134642.htm", "content": "\n　　鼓励制造业企业开展节能降碳技术改造，组织实施年节能量500吨标准煤及以上的省重点工业节能改造项目，按项目年节能量最高给予每吨标准煤500元奖励，单个项目最高奖励1000万元，且不超过总投资额的30%。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/nygl/202506/t20250630_2134642.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.03 09:56:00", "doctitle": "《关于推动制造业绿色低碳发展的若干措施》出台后，支持企业加快节能升级改造的费用是多少？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379621, "sourcename": "福建省工业和信息化厅", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/nygl/202506/t20250630_2134642.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/nygl/202506/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2134657, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/nzgl/202506/t20250630_2134657.htm", "content": "\n　　工业和信息化领域有效期内的省级专精特新中小企业和国家专精特新“小巨人”企业（不包括厦门市企业）。企业应正常生产经营，无严重不良信用记录。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/nzgl/202506/t20250630_2134657.htm", "docreltime": "2025.02.12 10:00:00", "doctitle": "福建省专精特新中小企业专项资金贷款支持对象有哪些？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379623, "sourcename": "福建省工业和信息化厅", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/nzgl/202506/t20250630_2134657.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/nzgl/202506/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2074735, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/gygl/202411/t20241104_2074735.htm", "content": "\n　　一是有序推动落实，坚持党建引领、统筹协调，强化法治思维。二是加强融资支持，加快谋划储备争取一批专项债项目、支持园区平台公司开展园区债发行试点、发行资产证券化产品，鼓励金融机构向园区项目建设和企业日", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/gygl/202411/t20241104_2074735.htm", "docreltime": "2024.08.22 11:15:00", "doctitle": "关于深化全省新一轮工业园区标准化建设的保障措施有哪些？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379617, "sourcename": "三明市工业和信息化局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/gygl/202411/t20241104_2074735.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jmw/gygl/202411/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1957756, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jrj/cjwt/202309/t20230926_1957756.htm", "content": "\n　　答：我局持续优化金融营商环境，强化金融供给，提升服务效率，助力实体经济发展。先后制定出台《三明市促进金融业加快发展若干措施》《关于进一步降低融资成本支持市场主体抗疫纾困的通知》等文件，抓好金融支持", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jrj/cjwt/202309/t20230926_1957756.htm", "docreltime": "2023.09.26 09:20:00", "doctitle": "问：在优化金融营商环境助力实体经济发展取得了哪些主要成效？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379616, "sourcename": "三明市金融局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jrj/cjwt/202309/t20230926_1957756.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jrj/cjwt/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1957609, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl/202309/t20230926_1957609.htm", "content": "\n　　(一)提升创新能力,包括创新驱动服务平台、科技创新重大项目、项目成果转化、产业提升工程;\n　　(二)推动协调发展,包括扶贫开发成果巩固与乡村振兴、城市公用基础设施企业债券贴息、自然灾害防治、公共管理; \n　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl/202309/t20230926_1957609.htm", "docreltime": "2023.09.26 09:16:00", "doctitle": "省级预算内投资重点投向有哪些？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379615, "sourcename": "e三明", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl/202309/t20230926_1957609.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tzl/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1942878, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/wjmj/dwmy/202309/t20230913_1942878.htm", "content": "\n　　出台背景：贯彻落实省委、省政府稳外资有关工作部署，推动更大力度吸引和利用外资。保持政策连续性、稳定性，高标准落实外资准入后国民待遇，保障外商投资企业依法依规平等享受我省产业发展和区域发展政策，积极", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/wjmj/dwmy/202309/t20230913_1942878.htm", "docreltime": "2023.09.01 11:11:00", "doctitle": "福建省商务厅和财政厅联合印发《关于促进外资扩增量稳存量提质量若干政策措施的通知》出台背景是？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379614, "sourcename": "市商务局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/wjmj/dwmy/202309/t20230913_1942878.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/wjmj/dwmy/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1853894, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jrj/cjwt/202212/t20221201_1853894.htm", "content": "\n　　答：三明市地方金融监督管理局持续优化金融营商环境，强化金融供给，提升服务效率，助力实体经济发展。一是信贷服务稳增长有力。先后制定出台《三明市促进金融业加快发展若干措施》《关于进一步降低融资成本支持", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jrj/cjwt/202212/t20221201_1853894.htm", "docreltime": "2022.12.01 10:22:00", "doctitle": "问：三明市地方金融监督管理局在优化金融营商环境助力实体经济发展取得了哪些主要成效？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379613, "sourcename": "三明市金融局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jrj/cjwt/202212/t20221201_1853894.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/jrj/cjwt/202212/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1852208, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202211/t20221129_1852208.htm", "content": "\n　　目前，企业用户用水报装可以选择线上办和线下办两种方式，两种方式都只要填写一次安装登记表我们即可上门安装。线上办理需登录三明市工程建设项目网上办事大厅，填写“用户申请安装登记表”即可完成用水报装业务", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202211/t20221129_1852208.htm", "docreltime": "2022.11.29 15:27:00", "doctitle": "企业用户用水报装需要什么手续吗？要不要缴纳费用？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379612, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202211/t20221129_1852208.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1848959, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/rsj/ldgxhldwq/202211/t20221122_1848959.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市人社局、住建局、交通运输局、水利局和发改委联合印发《三明市工程建设领域农民工工资保证金管理实施细则》，在遵循全省统一有关规定的基础上，进一步规范了工资保证金监管部门、存储比例、存储方式、存储", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/rsj/ldgxhldwq/202211/t20221122_1848959.htm", "docreltime": "2022.11.22 09:52:00", "doctitle": "我市农民工工资保证金管理具体细则是什么？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379611, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/rsj/ldgxhldwq/202211/t20221122_1848959.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/rsj/ldgxhldwq/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1848895, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/rsj/gwykl_28975/202211/t20221122_1848895.htm", "content": "\n　　为践行以人民为中心的发展思想，落实中央、省、市关于深化“放管服”改革优化营商环境的工作部署，根据福建省人社厅关于印发《福建省人社系统开展行风建设提升行动  持续优化人社政务服务实施意见》的通知（闽人", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/rsj/gwykl_28975/202211/t20221122_1848895.htm", "docreltime": "2022.11.22 09:31:00", "doctitle": "三明市人社系统在人社政务服务方面有哪些好的举措？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379610, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/rsj/gwykl_28975/202211/t20221122_1848895.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/rsj/gwykl_28975/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1849041, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tgl_22650/202211/t20221122_1849041.htm", "content": "\n　　信用承诺是构建以信用为基础的新型市场监管机制的重要内容，是创新社会治理方式，加强事中事后监管的重要举措，是推动市场主体自我约束，诚信经营的重要手段，是深化“放管服”改革，优化营商环境的内在要求。信", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tgl_22650/202211/t20221122_1849041.htm", "docreltime": "2022.08.09 10:34:00", "doctitle": "什么是信用承诺？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379609, "sourcename": "三明市粮食局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tgl_22650/202211/t20221122_1849041.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/fgw/tgl_22650/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1775925, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "知识", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202204/t20220411_1775925.htm", "content": "\n　　市国资委本着打通便民服务“最后一公里”，提供更优服务，让企业和群众有更多实实在在的获得感的宗旨，扎实推进市属国有企业做好我市优化营商环境工作。供水供气企业进一步优化流程，压减用水用气报装时间。用户", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202204/t20220411_1775925.htm", "docreltime": "2022.04.11 16:25:00", "doctitle": "市属国有企业在优化营商环境方面有哪些举措？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2379608, "sourcename": "市国资委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202204/t20220411_1775925.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/hdjlzsk/gzw/jgl/202204/", "rels": []}]}